* **Enemy Reaction (Predatory Disruptor):** Enemies in the immediate arc do not simply take damage; their AI executes a **Recoil & Panic State**. Monsters step backward, drop their guard, and lose initiative as Kaelen's unnatural, frictionless velocity violently violates their combat expectations.  
